<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan bank operation nets 1.8 bln mln rupees.</title>
<headline>Pakistan bank operation nets 1.8 bln mln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank said on Thursday it had accepted 1.8 billion rupees in an open market operation in Short-Term Federal Bonds.</p>
<p>				     Offered  Accepted	Max cut-off</p>
<p>Outright sales (million rupees)  6,670    nil	     nil</p>
<p>Five-month repo		  1,800    1,800	   16.98 pct</p>
<p>Three-month repo		 nil	nil	     nil</p>
<p>One-month repo		   nil	nil	     nil</p>
<p>Total				8,470    1,800</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees) -- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
